#   text[start+2:] = "double", no '*' -> returns Str("*")
#   p.pos advances to end or start+2

# So the behavior is:
# "**double" = Str("**") + Str("*") + Str("double")
# = "***double" in output!

# The fix: in the count>=2 case, when ** fails, try * with just 1 star
# If that also fails, return all the stars as literal

